ub-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ddd9a37efc68fc09709bda0c48895f952d805233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/commits/ddd9a37efc68fc09709bda0c48895f952d805233","html_url":"https://github.com/BeniCheni/elenchus/commit/ddd9a37efc68fc09709bda0c48895f952d805233"}]},{"sha":"34d078bb4a12ab56f464cfc8e7cfbd947cc7dca3","node_id":"C_kwDOVws8odoAKDM0ZDA3OGJiNGExMmFiNTZmNDY0Y2ZjOGU3Y2ZiZDk0N2NjN2RjYTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Benjamin Chen","email":"benjaminlchen@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-14T21:00:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-14T21:00:29Z"},"message":"v0.5.4 — extra time and penalties are finals of their own (#316)\n\nESPN's STATUS_FINAL_AET and STATUS_FINAL_PEN are stored as after_extra_time and after_penalties, with ESPN's score and, for a penalty final, the shootout. One such result no longer refuses the snapshot for every league. A finished row reads AET or PENS and never FT, and the form guide still counts only a full-time result. A change from one final status to another is urgent at any horizon, and a correction of the shootout alone is an urgent result change. A final whose score or shootout is missing or malformed, or whose shootout is level, is refused, and that refuses the whole snapshot.\n\nBuilt and rebutted by Cursor, reviewed cold by Claude; Pass 2.5 and the re-read ran on GPT-6.1 Sol. Not done: a 90-minute score (docs/v0.2.6-ideas.md row 118) and containing an unknown status to its own competition (row 119). The merge day moved from Mon 16 Nov to Sat 14 Nov 2026 on Beni's word.\n\nA match may go long. The sync no longer stops for it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"901a65f1d8b63df18dc4326ddd5edb23f9661666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/git/trees/901a65f1d8b63df18dc4326ddd5edb23f9661666"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/git/commits/34d078bb4a12ab56f464cfc8e7cfbd947cc7dca3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq+MvtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk0EQADAQ+4dHuOJ7QoKGFOwCIeuj\nl6hKgYnuywdOOHQ20q0Oz08v7i8HoYFZnJYf5kMYSj19SgSNaMzSiiwFRDPyLuQN\nN6C8ag4MwJ7ep0wlWd8SzROstL/PFPqsIc2gaonDW6jvmitVmy/SAFHMIJVb7QEz\n0Z4NxrfkZZe9y/40WdzCDPxUOtaevzlS8+akKBxv5MwUeiKQDbXgolGKS0IIljVJ\nnSI+hyOqkHC5Qr4t9BphDqqeALjd1FWOsfm8OX+RZxKDXKKthF4K9k8z6bRF3/V3\nkbmkhCe0LfLcb25CMSSspv+IKBqguwDcGS8bN4s80asYbBw8JcKCwL0IkhG9ZJxl\nBlHSCoFTTzs+AXRd9knowHDfifv2447nDB1GfI2v6TUvnaiTNA21FiN0ZurE6Gif\nYETGjqw3o8lxQFkM/4+KOWJ2ONp+0xgKykIBetG2K103SwFr6mj0+QLkoAh/V1Ma\n4lHMDz9tvBce4IvUZTj9A/KqJ82dX+9RKsub0XRIBWt6nagGGIm8Ione0qTtyfVR\n8Z8Iqdt3hv0JsSiF0+Indw8BjX+thnMOj/tPhv2Mxu0lvuW0EJtwN3KpBqxOVoaD\n+JMpUlTVa2PAUo8uC224kmwEH3gzZxyx+i+bHO2ortU86XzvjvuekGj2ZygmGigQ\nNYoJoyaYnDBBhMCStgmk\n=iE/P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 901a65f1d8b63df18dc4326ddd5edb23f9661666\nparent f7775c9ab9170ffa7382c283320c9896b9a455e8\nauthor Benjamin Chen <benjaminlchen@gmail.com> 1794690029 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1794690029 -0500\n\nv0.5.4 — extra time and penalties are finals of their own (#316)\n\nESPN's STATUS_FINAL_AET and STATUS_FINAL_PEN are stored as after_extra_time and after_penalties, with ESPN's score and, for a penalty final, the shootout. One such result no longer refuses the snapshot for every league. A finished row reads AET or PENS and never FT, and the form guide still counts only a full-time result. A change from one final status to another is urgent at any horizon, and a correction of the shootout alone is an urgent result change. A final whose score or shootout is missing or malformed, or whose shootout is level, is refused, and that refuses the whole snapshot.\n\nBuilt and rebutted by Cursor, reviewed cold by Claude; Pass 2.5 and the re-read ran on GPT-6.1 Sol. Not done: a 90-minute score (docs/v0.2.6-ideas.md row 118) and containing an unknown status to its own competition (row 119). The merge day moved from Mon 16 Nov to Sat 14 Nov 2026 on Beni's word.\n\nA match may go long. The sync no longer stops for it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-11-16T18:37:55Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/commits/34d078bb4a12ab56f464cfc8e7cfbd947cc7dca3","html_url":"https://github.com/BeniCheni/elenchus/commit/34d078bb4a12ab56f464cfc8e7cfbd947cc7dca3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeniCheni/elenchus/commits/34d078bb4a12ab56f464cfc8e7cfbd947cc7dca3/comments","author":{"login":"BeniCheni","id":6441326,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDEzMjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6441326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni","html_url":"https://github.com/BeniCheni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BeniCheni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api